        "story_body": "<p>Founded in 2019, MaxFoot was born from a simple belief: everyone deserves the freedom of the open road. Recognizing a frustrating gap in the U.S. market between overpriced luxury trikes and low-quality alternatives, we stepped in to bridge the gap. By blending uncompromising safety, everyday practicality, and honest pricing, we engineer the best electric tricycles for adults.</p>",
